^{:go/end 1781} (go/method GetFuncDwarfAuxSyms "GetFuncDwarfAuxSyms collects and returns the auxiliary DWARF\nsymbols associated with a given function symbol.  Prior to the\nintroduction of the loader, this was done purely using name\nlookups, e.f. for function with name XYZ we would then look up\ngo.info.XYZ, etc.\n" [^{:tag (* Loader)} l ^Sym fnSymIdx] :results [^Sym auxDwarfInfo ^Sym auxDwarfLoc ^Sym auxDwarfRanges ^Sym auxDwarfLines]
